id: sl_rail_util_vdet
label: SL RAIL Utility, VDET
description: Utility to provide RAIL with Front End Module Voltage Detect (VDET) support. Allows ADC voltage measurements timed with the start of TX packets for tuning FEM performance.
package: rail_library
category: Platform|Radio
quality: experimental
metadata:
    sbom:
        id: sl_rail_util_vdet
        name: SL RAIL Utility, VDET
        license: Zlib
provides:
  - name: sl_rail_util_vdet
requires:
  - name: rail_util_vdet
define:
  - name: SL_RAIL_3_API
    value: '1'
